5,1,1,talk,George,,I think we should be thorough to ensure a fair arrangement for everyone. I'll look into what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the actual time commitment involved. I'll look into the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to understand the actual condition of the vehicle and how it's being maintained. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the mechanic's remarks at the last service.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to see the actual costs we've been paying. I'll look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as last year's fuel receipts.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know how we've been using the car and if the costs are fair. I'll look into the weeks of heavy use over the year and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
